OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot dead at memorial service
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was shot dead while families
OL,7,Fgathered at a memorial service in west
OL,8,FLondon has been named by police.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the junction of
OL,11,FBraybrook Street and Erconwald Street
OL,12,Fin East Acton at about 19:45 BST on 2
OL,13,FOctober after members of the public
OL,14,Fheard multiple shots.
OL,16,FLevi Davidson, 40, from west London,
OL,17,Fwas found with a gunshot wound to the
OL,18,Fchest and pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,19,FNo arrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
