OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot dead at memorial service
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police said more than
OL,7,F50 people were believed to have been in
OL,8,Fthe area and appealed for witnesses,
OL,9,Fadding: "The Met knows there are people
OL,10,Fwho witnessed important moments before,
OL,11,Fduring or after the shooting who have
OL,12,Fnot yet come forward."
